Step 3: Create Evidence Archive
Create a compressed archive for secure storage:

# Navigate to evidence collection directory
cd ~/evidence-collection

# Create compressed archive with timestamp
tar -czf evidence_archive_$(date +%Y%m%d_%H%M%S).tar.gz evidence_*/

# Verify archive was created
ls -lh evidence_archive_*.tar.gz

# Create hash of the archive for integrity
